        "verse": 5
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "2PE",
          "chapter": 1,
          "verse": 5
        }
      ],
      "en": "Yes, and for this very cause adding on your part all diligence, in your faith supply moral excellence; and in moral excellence, knowledge;",
      "ko": "이러므로 너희가 더욱 힘써 너희 믿음에 덕을, 덕에 지식을,",
      "source_text_hash": "e83f78506966303dae8b2c00e7225a930013db5f4894f096599abe32f0b058e0",
      "translation_text_hash": "3ecb8388f3f129ba2175b5bf6011fa7b736ee5bd8011e664a2724072d2600784",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "이러므로 너희가 더욱 힘써 너희 믿음에 덕을, 덕에 지식을,"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "3ecb8388f3f129ba2175b5bf6011fa7b736ee5bd8011e664a2724072d2600784"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:2PE:1:6",
      "sequence": 30482,
      "chapter_label": "2PE 1",
      "verse_label": "6",
      "locator": {
        "book": "2PE",
